From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Kamil=20Postro=C5=BCny?= <kamil@postrozny.pl>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 16:39:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] kk: MSL 4.0 by default on iOS 27; MESA_KK_EXPERIMENTAL=msl41
 for 4.1

mesa 0106's msl40 becomes the default. With a cleared shader cache,
Portal 2 stalled 14.3 s at MSL 4.0 against 17.0-17.1 s at 4.1 and
Hollow Knight 5.3 s against 7.5-7.6 s, two cold runs each; whole
pipeline builds took half the time and none failed.

So the device no longer advertises shaderSharedFloat32AtomicAdd, the
one feature that needs 4.1; DXVK and vkd3d-proton do not use it.
MESA_KK_EXPERIMENTAL=msl41 gives 4.1 and the feature back. The MSL text
does not change. The pipeline cache key covers the version, so caches
made at 4.1 are not used.

Linear: PLA-437
Class: ios-port
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-10-22-kk-gpl-cold-cache.md
Offered-upstream: no
---
 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c           | 2 +-
 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.h           | 8 ++++----
 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_physical_device.c | 7 ++++---
 3 files changed, 9 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c
index 35e2ddd..fb09572 100644
--- a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c
+++ b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c
@@ -45,7 +45,7 @@ const struct debug_named_value experimental_flags[] = {
    {"parallel_stages", KK_EXPERIMENTAL_PARALLEL_STAGES},
    {"library_size_opt", KK_EXPERIMENTAL_LIBRARY_SIZE_OPT},
    {"gpl", KK_EXPERIMENTAL_GPL},
-   {"msl40", KK_EXPERIMENTAL_MSL40},
+   {"msl41", KK_EXPERIMENTAL_MSL41},
    {NULL, 0},
 };
 
diff --git a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.h b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.h
index 2b4e5dc..65f2659 100644
--- a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.h
+++ b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.h
@@ -106,10 +106,10 @@ enum kk_experimental {
    /* Playport (PLA-424): advertise VK_EXT_graphics_pipeline_library; library
     * shaders compile apart and the draw links them (kk_gpl.c) */
    KK_EXPERIMENTAL_GPL = 1ull << 6,
-   /* Playport (PLA-437): compile MSL as 4.0 where the OS offers 4.1 (iOS
-    * 27), which builds libraries 2-2.6x faster on the phone; the device then
-    * does not advertise shaderSharedFloat32AtomicAdd, which needs 4.1 */
-   KK_EXPERIMENTAL_MSL40 = 1ull << 7,
+   /* Playport (PLA-437): compile MSL as 4.1 where the OS offers it (iOS 27)
+    * and advertise shaderSharedFloat32AtomicAdd, which needs it; by default
+    * MSL is 4.0, which builds libraries 2-2.6x faster on the phone */
+   KK_EXPERIMENTAL_MSL41 = 1ull << 7,
 };
 
 extern enum kk_experimental kk_mesa_experimental_flags;
diff --git a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_physical_device.c b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_physical_device.c
index 3aba446..becbbf8 100644
--- a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_physical_device.c
+++ b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_physical_device.c
@@ -1158,9 +1158,10 @@ get_metal_limits(struct kk_physical_device *pdev)
       mtl_device_get_gpu_apple_family(pdev->mtl_dev_handle);
 
    /* Determine the supported MSL version based on the OS. The version used to
-    * compile determines what features are available. MESA_KK_EXPERIMENTAL=
-    * msl40 keeps 4.0 (PLA-437). */
-   if (ns_is_os_version_at_least(27, 0, 0) && !KK_EXPERIMENTAL(MSL40))
+    * compile determines what features are available. Playport (PLA-437):
+    * 4.0 unless MESA_KK_EXPERIMENTAL=msl41, as the phone builds the same MSL
+    * 2-2.6x faster as 4.0. */
+   if (ns_is_os_version_at_least(27, 0, 0) && KK_EXPERIMENTAL(MSL41))
       pdev->info.msl_version = MTL_LANGUAGE_VERSION_4_1;
    else
       pdev->info.msl_version = MTL_LANGUAGE_VERSION_4_0;
